				Time="2011-12-09T04:55:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデクさんに　教えてもらったこと
きみも　知りたい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T05:05:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
